       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LINFORM.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT FORMED ASSIGN TO "FORMED".
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  FORMED LINAGE 4 WITH FOOTING 3 LINES AT TOP 2
           LINES AT BOTTOM 1.
       01  FREC PIC X(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           OPEN OUTPUT FORMED
           MOVE "A" TO FREC WRITE FREC AFTER 0
           MOVE "B" TO FREC WRITE FREC BEFORE 0
           MOVE "C" TO FREC WRITE FREC AFTER 3
           MOVE "D" TO FREC WRITE FREC AFTER 2
           MOVE "E" TO FREC WRITE FREC BEFORE PAGE
           MOVE "F G " TO FREC WRITE FREC
           CLOSE FORMED
           STOP RUN.
